    "summary": "Keep H5-08 = 0, set H5-01..H5-03, then b1-01 = 2 and b1-02 = 2 so the frequency reference and Run come from Modbus. Write 0001H (run bits) and 0002H (frequency reference) with function 10H and poll 0020H, 0021H and 002CH.",
