    "enable": "H5-08 = 0 selects Modbus (3 = BACnet). Set H5-01 node address (default 1FH), H5-02 speed (default 3 = 9600 bps) and H5-03 parity (default 0 = none), then power-cycle or set H5-20 = 1. For control set b1-01 = 2 and b1-02 = 2.",
    "watchdog": "H5-05 = 1 (default) enables CE detection; H5-09 sets the timeout (0.0-25.0 s, default 2.0 s) and H5-04 the reaction (0 ramp, 1 coast, 2 fast stop, 3 alarm only - default). Drive status 2 (002CH) bit F shows a timeout.",
